{"id":"sh/36tkruts","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":145,"width":1184,"height":67},"text":"Each case makes a different question concrete. Wavelength is the “color” of infrared light. Quality flags identify pixels that need care.","style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#AFB6BA","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
