{"id":"sh/sbyhsva5","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":287,"top":419,"width":945,"height":94},"text":"A five-month pair explores time at similar wavelengths. The pictured pair shows 2.3232 and 4.9399 µm at the same moment. The learner separates wavelength from time and checks display contrast before comparing gray levels.","style":{"fontSize":22.51,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
