{"id":"sh/h0ri50r2","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":287,"top":560,"width":945,"height":94},"text":"A flagged bright dot appears to move over three days. A detector-coordinate control explains its sky shift as the pointing changes. The learner can reject a moving-object claim using the flags and a testable alternative.","style":{"fontSize":22.51,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0}
